---
import { cases, resultsHref, normalizeBase } from '../../../metadata-cases/cases';
import { Content as Sessions } from '../../../metadata-cases/results/sessions.md';
import { Content as Hosting } from '../../../metadata-cases/results/hosting.md';
import { Content as Reporting } from '../../../metadata-cases/results/reporting.md';
import '../../../metadata-cases/ui.css';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const groups = [...new Set(cases.map(c => c.group))];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <title>Recorded results — Metadata Lab</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="results">
      <nav aria-label="Results navigation">
        <p><a href={`${normalizeBase(base)}cases/`}>All cases</a>{' · '}<a href={`${normalizeBase(base)}cases/testing/`}>Testing guide</a>{' · '}<a href="#reporting-shortcuts">Reporting labels and formats</a></p>
      </nav>
      <h1>Recorded test results</h1>
      <p>Tell me your browser/app, version and device once, then send case IDs and observations. We will record them in the tables and retain unknown details as unknown.</p>
      <pre><code>Run: B003 | mode=[light/dark] | surface=[tab/tab-switcher]{ '\n' }icons/ico32-svg = [label]{ '\n' }icons/svg-ico32 = [label]</code></pre>
      <p>This is a reporting example. Start with browser icons, then theming, mobile head/language and online installation. Next, use the five precedence cases in each messaging app before expanding the social matrix.</p>
      <p>Case records contain the relevant tables. Untested differs from no visible result. These pages display repository records; updates appear after rebuilding and deploying. Share the fixture URL when testing a preview.</p>
      <nav aria-label="Result groups">
        <ul class="group-links">{groups.map(group => <li><a href={`#${group}`}>{group}</a></li>)}</ul>
      </nav>
      {groups.map(group => (
        <section aria-labelledby={group}>
          <h2 id={group}>{group}</h2>
          <ul>{cases.filter(c => c.group === group).map(c => <li><a href={resultsHref(c, base)}>{c.id}</a></li>)}</ul>
        </section>
      ))}
      <Reporting />
      <section aria-label="Test run details" class="table-scroll" tabindex="0">
        <Sessions />
      </section>
      <section aria-label="Reported HTTP probes" class="table-scroll" tabindex="0">
        <Hosting />
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
